{
    "word": "coryphaeus",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                "word": "coryphaeus",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b9be7b33-c369-435a-bb5b-b905abca2b7c",
                        "entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "coryphaeuses"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c0b79a2f-47c3-4f4d-af78-a77d226d663b",
                        "entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "coryphaei"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36dba6b7-eb48-3486-9bc8-5a41950254a9",
                        "entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The conductor or leader of the chorus of a drama."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "434a625a-78e5-4648-969e-080e556da1fd",
                                "sense_id": "36dba6b7-eb48-3486-9bc8-5a41950254a9",
                                "text": "Then the coryphæus finishes the remaining part of the strophe. But when they have returned to order, Bacchus again interposes by beginning the antistrophe β', which the coryphæus ought to have done."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23e415d5-07b0-441e-bf12-8baccfbc3321",
                                "sense_id": "36dba6b7-eb48-3486-9bc8-5a41950254a9",
                                "text": "The chorus, that is those members of the komos who have not become specialized as actors and continue singing and dancing, are headed by a coryphaeus, who sometimes addresses them, exhorting them to action, or to begin the song or the rite, or else anticipates or summarizes their words, or represents them in conversation with the actors."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f0c74bd-d390-4ec4-886c-859c301c50c1",
                                "sense_id": "36dba6b7-eb48-3486-9bc8-5a41950254a9",
                                "text": "Post-classical references to the famous ‘chorus-trainer’ Sannio indicate that his role extended to performing and thus taking the coryphaeus role. The coryphaeus was both leader and teacher, and in performance played a crucial role in setting the time that the other dancers followed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c84a7be-0f22-39e9-bfe7-3c190ed35a7d",
                        "entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The chief or leader of an interest or party."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c0788d5-f5e4-4aad-8815-75177d074c2b",
                                "sense_id": "0c84a7be-0f22-39e9-bfe7-3c190ed35a7d",
                                "text": "Of the work which I have done, it becomes me not here to speak, save only as relates to the Satanic School, and its Coryphæus, the author of Don Juan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3eaa0da4-cc7a-477b-8ad1-d93a78b3326c",
                                "sense_id": "0c84a7be-0f22-39e9-bfe7-3c190ed35a7d",
                                "text": "1986, Ladislav Matejka, I. R. Titunik, Translators' Preface, V. N. Vološinov, Marxism and the Philosophy of Language, page vii,\nAmong those rare exceptions, fortunately, was that coryphaeus of modern thought in the humanities, Professor Roman Jakobson."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65cd9e43-b368-41b8-b1e1-3a4236c87ab2",
                                "sense_id": "0c84a7be-0f22-39e9-bfe7-3c190ed35a7d",
                                "text": "1997, Ignaz Goldziher, Wolfgang Behn (editor and translator), The Zāhirīs: Their Doctrine and Their History, page 123,\nIndeed, when we make a comparative study of the Zāhirite school's known coryphaei of the different periods for their dogmatic point of view, we shall soon find out that the most divergent, diametrically opposed dogmatic branches could be combined as belonging to the Zāhirite fiqh school."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39356ce6-228e-4af8-af76-e4e74df8964e",
                                "sense_id": "0c84a7be-0f22-39e9-bfe7-3c190ed35a7d",
                                "text": "My dad was a highly active member of Zoryaniy Shlyah—Kyiv’s possibly first (and possibly only, at the time) sci-fi fan club—the name means \"Star Trek\" in Ukrainian, unsurprisingly. He translated some Stansilaw Lem (of Solaris and Futurological Congress fame) from Polish to Russian in the early 80s and was generally considered a coryphaeus at ZSh."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb0a41b5-f37f-3176-8219-b44a25a661b7",
                        "entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The leader of an opera chorus or another ensemble of singers."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dce73a18-f15a-4b79-9fcd-e1b074b2f004",
                        "source_entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "source_sense_description": "conductor of the dramatic chorus",
                        "target_lang_word": "coryfee",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coryfee",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "068f1715-2f67-3674-83be-060192ca9806",
                                        "entry_id": "35a89ac6-22b2-3fbe-92ea-e41601401a04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "bekend iemand met goede eigenschappen, uitblinker, een ster, bekende Nederlander, beroemdheid"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccef4f17-553e-4940-bb1b-ebce6e906afc",
                                                "sense_id": "068f1715-2f67-3674-83be-060192ca9806",
                                                "text": "Allerlei coryfeeën deden mee aan de inzamelingsactie voor Nepal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85a2f511-8d92-49a6-9a7b-674c2cd0ff22",
                                                "sense_id": "068f1715-2f67-3674-83be-060192ca9806",
                                                "text": "„Wilders is een wolf in schaapskleren”, zegt CDA-coryfee Gerd Leers tijdens de verkiezingsavond."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1076e3b9-9e53-4909-b67c-74771dad47b2",
                        "source_entry_id": "d0d88ff3-2397-3930-9e95-d2d4d4c3bc69",
                        "source_sense_description": "conductor of the dramatic chorus",
                        "target_lang_word": "Koryphäe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Koryphäe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                        "entry_id": "c6d5ead5-5325-33dd-8525-cec8e6a77744",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine herausragende Persönlichkeit in einem wissenschaftlichen Fachgebiet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cdd8d4-0f23-4a4e-a1cf-7b1bd4bd9774",
                                                "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                                "text": "Er ist eine Koryphäe auf seinem Gebiet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faa3ab92-0abf-44f5-9fec-6b6c91eb814a",
                                                "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                                "text": "„Wenngleich das Geschäft mit Skiurlaubern lukrativer war, spielten die Dorfbewohner den Sommer hindurch mit nicht geringem Stolz Gastgeber erlauchter Versammlungen von Koryphäen der Wissenschaft und anderer Prominenz.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4761cc5c-8ee5-4de5-97ce-54cb477a5c2a",
                                                "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                                "text": "„Fachlich hält der Demeter-Bäcker Lecht viel von Professor Brümmer, als Koryphäe für Sauerteig- und Hefegärung verdient der großen Respekt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a44b88ce-f0aa-41b4-9215-674a05ec0a60",
                                                "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                                "text": "„Auch die Rezensenten behandelten Darwin längst als Koryphäe.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "106e166b-9c38-4172-87ba-16732f4f0bfa",
                                                "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                                "text": "„Er galt als Koryphäe auf seinem Gebiet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef5fa281-e225-41df-be43-66681002ff11",
                                                "sense_id": "2722a7a1-b5fe-38e9-ae5e-2156b1c491fc",
                                                "text": "„Wie in einem Schneeballsystem reihten sich die Sätze aus den Raubdrucken revolutionärer Koryphäen aneinander.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
